            "rationale": "Every new effect goes through an existing port: Archive.Load/Save for backups, Files.ReadLines for the existence check, and Store.Load/Save. The change also removes the CLI's direct use of JsonFileStore.create, so presentation no longer depends on Lending.Host.Persistence. No effect is added in Tier 1/2. Minor note: loadBackup's catch-all turns an unreadable backup into 'no backup' (an ARC-HEU-01-style finding), and the existence check reads the whole file through ReadLines. Neither bypasses a port.",
